1
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:09,200
Yaboo! Yaboo! Yaboo! Yaboo!

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,660
You're on a move.

3
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:40,120
It's time to duel.

4
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,059
You're my failure.

5
00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:44,500
Time for you to pay up, Pharaoh.

6
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,190
No!

7
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:51,410
Yugi, stop!

8
00:01:51,493 --> 00:01:52,620
What are you doing here?

9
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:56,640
It only needs one of us, so I'm
letting the seal take me instead.

10
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,390
No!

11
00:01:59,473 --> 00:02:00,303
Yugi!

12
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:08,160
Hold on.

13
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:10,080
Was it all a dream?

14
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:13,280
Teya, wake up.

15
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:17,680
Where are we?

16
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,680
The last thing I remember, we were...

17
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:24,840
No, Teya!

18
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,740
Skye, get back here! Skye!

19
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:34,980
That's no way to treat our guests.

20
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,720
Sorry if she woke you up.

21
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:37,740
Who are you?

22
00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:39,840
You can call me Chris.

23
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,080
You've already met Skye.

24
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,997
She's the one who found you.

25
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:48,551
She was sniffing around for food and
ended up sniffing out you guys instead.

26
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,100
This is strange.

27
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,750
Skye.

28
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,440
I see your strength is back.

29
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,000
Yes, thank you.

30
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,017
Pleased to hear it.

31
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:10,453
You two had me worried.

32
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:14,860
By the way, the name is Ironheart,
and I believe this belongs to you.

33
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,120
Pardon me for being intrusive,

34
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:22,840
but I couldn't help noticing you
possess the legendary Eye of Tomaeus.

35
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:25,940
The only one of its kind. Take it.

36
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,840
I'm not deserving of its power.

37
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:30,220
That's not true.

38
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,842
I'll hold it until you're ready.

39
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,980
Did you find another kid?

40
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:37,560
He had glasses and a bad haircut.

41
00:03:37,700 --> 00:03:40,288
He was on the train
with us when it crashed.

42
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:43,145
No, I'm afraid you were
the only ones we found.

43
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:47,637
Perhaps your friend was able to escape
before the train fell off that cliff.

44
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:50,544
I assure you there wasn't
another soul on board.

45
00:03:51,140 --> 00:03:55,940
I highly doubt Weevil was able to
escape, not in the condition he was in.

46
00:03:56,180 --> 00:03:59,200
I'm afraid there's a
greater power at work here.

47
00:03:59,540 --> 00:04:01,320
I must say, young man,

48
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:05,780
you seem to possess a wisdom that
reaches far beyond your years.

49
00:04:05,980 --> 00:04:08,697
Now, I've encountered
many people in my travels,

50
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:11,897
but there's something about
you I've never seen before.

51
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:13,600
Something in your eyes.

52
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:18,275
I'm also sensing that you hold a great
deal of loneliness in your heart.

53
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:23,080
That's because I recently lost a
very close friend of mine And now,

54
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:25,660
I'm on a journey to find his soul

55
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:29,100
What will you do if you find him?

56
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:34,100
I'll apologize for betraying
his trust and abandoning him

57
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,160
I might just be able to help

58
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,140
Follow me

59
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:47,020
Uh, Mr. Ironheart, sir?

60
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:48,778
Where are we going?

61
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,600
Patience, my dear friend.

62
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,750
Taya!

63
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:59,500
Did I mention to watch your step?

64
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:03,980
Oh, and it's probably better if
you don't look down. Don't worry.

65
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,817
Our destination's not
very far from here at all.

66
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,547
What happens when we arrive?

67
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:12,977
We'll have crossed over to the other side,
to the place where the spirits dwell.

68
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:17,980
You see, my people believe that
human souls exist all around us.

69
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:21,200
And just beyond this
mountain is a sacred valley,

70
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:24,988
where drifting souls are said
to gather as they wander along.

71
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,556
And you think my friend may be there?

72
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:30,860
Perhaps, but there are
evil spirits there as well.

73
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:33,260
Finding the soul you seek is easy.

74
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:35,714
Leaving with your own is another thing.

75
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:38,660
It's not too late to back out.

76
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,897
I must go.

77
00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:42,440
I owe it to Yugi.

78
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:55,560
Hey, Pharaoh, you in there or not?

79
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:58,640
How did he escape?

80
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:04,540
I'll find you, Pharaoh, wherever you are!

81
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:13,980
There it is So what do
we do when we get there?

82
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:19,380
Not we You must enter the Sacred
Circle on your own After all,

83
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:23,620
this is your journey Very
well, I accept the challenge

84
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:26,050
Yugi!

85
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,060
Wait up!

86
00:06:29,460 --> 00:06:31,040
Teya, come back!

87
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,390
Huh?

88
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:36,080
Only one soul seeker is
permitted to enter at a time.

89
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:40,129
If you proceed, the evil spirits
will sense you immediately.

90
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,330
Be careful.

91
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:47,960
Yugi, I know you're here.

92
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,780
Someone is right.

93
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:57,940
Who's there?

94
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,540
Show yourself!

95
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:12,400
What's happening?

96
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:16,640
Your friends attracting lost
souls that seek revenge.

97
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,920
Your mother's kiss!

98
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:27,120
Your spirit will join us!

99
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,957
I'm letting the shield go.

100
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,981
Take me instead.

101
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:03,930
Yugi!

102
00:08:08,220 --> 00:08:09,900
You see that, Teya?

103
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:14,700
It means the spirit's crossing
over into our world. Keep watching.

104
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:23,960
Is that really you?

105
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:25,570
Yugi!

106
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:27,360
Hey, it's him!

107
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:28,800
I found you.

108
00:08:32,940 --> 00:08:36,640
You came all this way
just to see me? Of course.

109
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:38,780
I wanted to say how sorry I am.

110
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:39,880
I'm sorry too.

111
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:42,157
I wish this whole thing never happened.

112
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,180
It's my fault.

113
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:45,459
I surrendered to my inner darkness.

114
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:49,080
I allowed my anger to take
over and you paid the price.

115
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:50,975
Now that you're gone,

116
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:55,177
the darkness is starting to grow
without your light to keep me pure.

117
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:57,000
I'm becoming evil, Yugi.

118
00:08:57,800 --> 00:09:01,617
I'm beginning to believe that what
Raphael said about me is true.

119
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:04,240
Perhaps I was a wicked pharaoh.

120
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:06,000
I heard about you.

121
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,280
How you ruled as an evil king.

122
00:09:08,580 --> 00:09:09,874
That's right, pharaoh.

123
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:14,080
You used the power of the
Shadow Realm to destroy Egypt.

124
00:09:15,340 --> 00:09:18,987
What if I am the one responsible
for the destruction of Egypt?

125
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:21,477
If I'm capable of such horrific behavior

126
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,757
that it's my soul that
should be locked away.

127
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,487
Well, what good is that now?

128
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:28,417
I'm the one who's been
locked away forever.

129
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:29,330
Not you.

130
00:09:29,413 --> 00:09:34,060
I'm sorry Well, the last thing I need is
your pity Pharaoh if you're really evil.

131
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:37,120
There's only one thing to
do What are you saying?

132
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:43,657
You said it yourself didn't you
your spirit should be locked

133
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:48,980
away with mine and I'm gonna do
it Wait you misunderstood me.

134
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:52,828
Oh, so now you're taking back
what you said make up your mind

135
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:55,907
You don't deserve to be
a part of this world.

136
00:09:56,140 --> 00:09:56,970
Yugi.

137
00:09:57,140 --> 00:10:01,517
It's about time you started taking some
responsibility for what you've done.

138
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,477
There's only one thing
left to do and you know it.

139
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:07,854
You need to be a man for once
and face me in a duel now.

140
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,080
No, please.

141
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,450
Too late.

142
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,231
It's time for you to pay.

143
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:15,240
If you're really sorry,
then you'll do this.

144
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:19,000
It's time to duel.

145
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:24,260
Wait, so he's gonna duel himself?

146
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:25,840
But why?

147
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:28,040
This is the only way.

148
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:33,300
That's why we took you guys here, so
the pharaoh can face his other half.

149
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:38,501
He has to deal with what he did so he can
put it all behind him and finally move on.

150
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:40,424
How do you know all this stuff?

151
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,880
We've always known this.

152
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:46,097
We were taught that a warrior
would come to save our world.

153
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:49,827
And as soon as we found you guys,
we knew that he was the one.

154
00:10:50,060 --> 00:10:51,942
So what's he supposed to do now?

155
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:55,137
His first step is to
face his inner fears and

156
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:57,877
conquer the darkness that
lurks within his heart.

157
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:02,640
But if he loses this battle, the
Pharaoh's spirit will remain here forever.

158
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:13,760
All right, I'll start things off by
summoning one monster face down on the field.

159
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:19,537
now let's see what you've got
unless you're too scared very

160
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:26,020
well if i must i summon gazelle
the king of mythical beasts

161
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,840
now gazelle attack his face down card

162
00:11:34,220 --> 00:11:35,780
mine's a gazelle too

163
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:40,640
they played the same card
their hands are identical

164
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:42,410
Yugi, wait!

165
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:44,913
We're holding the same cards, aren't we?

166
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,540
Let's find out.

167
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:49,380
I'll summon another card face down.

168
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,920
Do these look familiar?

169
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,520
Polymerization and Burf-O-Met.

170
00:11:55,680 --> 00:12:01,840
Now I can fuse my two monsters together to
form Chimera, the flying mythical beast.

171
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:08,100
Next I'll play Alpha, the Magnet Warrior.

172
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:12,860
Now, attack his face down, monster!

173
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:18,020
Your defense is gone!

174
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:21,180
Chimera, attack his life points directly!

175
00:12:25,900 --> 00:12:26,800
That's strange.

176
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:31,318
If we do have the same hand, then
why didn't Yugi play Monster Reborn?

177
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:35,517
He could have used it to bring back
his gazelle and block my attack.

178
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,677
For some reason, he's holding back.

179
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:41,100
Could Yugi be trying to
lose the duel on purpose?

180
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:45,676
Or is he trying to throw me off with
a strategy he's never used before?

181
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:51,060
When you destroyed my Sandkin,
you activated its special ability,

182
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:54,640
letting me move a monster
from my deck to my hand.

183
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,840
Yes, good move.

184
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:58,789
I don't need your support.

185
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,420
I place this face down.

186
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,860
Then I'll play this!

187
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,180
Card Destruction!

188
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:06,600
But why?

189
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:10,379
So I can start over and our
hands will be different.

190
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:11,910
Disappointed?

191
00:13:11,993 --> 00:13:13,587
Now you can't cheat anymore.

192
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,160
Why are you acting like this?

193
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:18,380
I'm just a reflection of you.

194
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:20,020
What do you mean, Yugi?

195
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,940
You don't get it, do you?

196
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:24,084
You and I are exactly the same.

197
00:13:24,420 --> 00:13:28,640
So the darkness that's in your
heart is also inside my heart.

198
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:32,740
Yugi, I wish I could
take it back. Too late.

199
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,317
You've already shown
me who you really are.

200
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:38,180
An evil pharaoh who
cares only about himself!

201
00:13:38,820 --> 00:13:40,040
Face the facts!

202
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:44,480
You didn't care what happened
to me so long as you had power!

203
00:13:44,820 --> 00:13:47,220
Now it's my turn! Yugi, wait!

204
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:49,657
Are you holding the card I think you are?

205
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:53,858
It sounds like you're starting to
catch on, aren't you, your highness?

206
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:58,877
This duel is a chance for you to
look at yourself from the outside.

207
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:02,019
And there's only one card
that can make that happen.

208
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:04,040
The Seal of Orikalkos.

209
00:14:04,980 --> 00:14:05,810
Yugi, no!

210
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:22,480
Now it's payback time for taking my sword!

211
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:24,120
This is a mistake!

212
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:27,300
Come on, just replace your hand already!

213
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:28,991
I played Car Destruction!

214
00:14:29,460 --> 00:14:31,220
Or don't you remember?

215
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:36,840
and now for my next move
i activate monster reborn

216
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:42,760
and i'll use it to bring
back my dark magician girl

217
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:47,540
then i'll summon my
obnoxious chelchic guardian

218
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:54,477
pharaoh you know what happens next stop

219
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:57,660
this now now the orichalco
serves my monsters

220
00:15:06,540 --> 00:15:10,220
Now, my Celtic Guardian,
destroy his Magnet Warrior!

221
00:15:14,780 --> 00:15:16,797
Your turn, Dark Magician Girl!

222
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:18,880
Incinerate his mythical beast!

223
00:15:24,500 --> 00:15:29,940
I'll use Chimera's special ability
to summon Burplenet in defense mode!

224
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,600
Big deal!

225
00:15:32,980 --> 00:15:34,333
What else have you got?

226
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,420
I've got this!

227
00:15:37,380 --> 00:15:40,660
The mighty Big Shield
Gardener in defense mode!

228
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:45,160
This should protect my life points
from Dark Magician Girl's attack.

229
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,180
That's all?

230
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:50,640
I play Queen's Knight in attack mode!

231
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:57,517
And to boost my firepower,
I'll activate Magic Formula!

232
00:15:57,600 --> 00:16:02,000
It raises Dark Magician
Girl's attack points by 500!

233
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:05,500
3,000 attack points?

234
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:07,640
Queen's Knight attack!

235
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:14,860
And now for my Dark Magician Girl!

236
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:17,680
Take out his Big Shield Gardener!

237
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:22,340
But wait, there's more!

238
00:16:22,640 --> 00:16:24,060
Go, Kilted Guardian!

239
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:32,420
It won't be long now, Pharaoh.

240
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:35,640
Yugi, don't do this.

241
00:16:35,780 --> 00:16:37,020
It hurts, doesn't it?

242
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:38,620
And it only gets worse.

243
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:42,400
Soon you'll be locked away
forever, where you belong.

244
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:49,000
I'll place one card face down and summon
Giant Soldier of Stone in defense mode.

245
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:54,100
Next, I activate my Swords
of the Feeling Light.

246
00:16:56,960 --> 00:17:00,620
This gives me three turns to
talk some sense into Yugi.

247
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:02,391
Your swords mean nothing.

248
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:05,780
I have a card that can
blast right through them.

249
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,697
You should have known that.

250
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:09,740
It's a card you've played before.

251
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:15,000
Now I sacrifice my guardian
to summon Catapult Turtle.

252
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:20,137
This is what I did last time. Exactly.

253
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:24,720
So it's time for you to experience
the consequences of your own evil.

254
00:17:25,120 --> 00:17:27,140
Now you'll never duel again.

255
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:28,660
It's all over.

256
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:32,100
All right, Queen's
Knight, I sacrifice you!

257
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:36,900
Yugi, no!

258
00:17:37,620 --> 00:17:40,300
Dark Magician Girl, your turn!

259
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:42,680
Go on!

260
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,920
Launch, Catapult Turtle!

261
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:48,100
Launch, Catapult Turtle!

262
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:07,340
One more attack and you'll become a
prisoner of the Orichalcos just like me.

263
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:09,880
Oh no, I can't lose.

264
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:15,720
If I do, then I can't set you free
and two worlds will crumble. So what?

265
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:16,997
You're evil, remember?

266
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:17,910
Remember?

267
00:18:17,993 --> 00:18:20,320
Last time, you didn't care who suffered!

268
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:24,840
Yugi, I'm begging you!

269
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:27,760
Please, don't go through
with this! Too late.

270
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:29,410
Attack!

271
00:18:31,100 --> 00:18:32,017
Yugi, no!

272
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,900
I won't let you do this!

273
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:39,320
I activate the trap card, Divine Wind!

274
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:43,920
He did it!

275
00:18:44,980 --> 00:18:49,274
He was able to reverse my attack and
double its strength to win the duel.

276
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:53,860
What have I done? Yugi!

277
00:18:56,140 --> 00:18:57,320
Is he all right?

278
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:00,610
Yugi!

279
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:03,550
Come on.

280
00:19:03,633 --> 00:19:04,860
Speak to me, please.

281
00:19:05,820 --> 00:19:07,460
You passed the test, pal.

282
00:19:08,420 --> 00:19:10,008
What are you talking about?

283
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:11,900
Did you plan this all along?

284
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:14,600
It was the only way.

285
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:19,745
By defeating me, you were able to defeat
the darkness that was inside your heart.

286
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:23,997
It wasn't easy, but you did what
was best for me and for mankind.

287
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:26,360
You acted like a true hero.

288
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,100
But now what?

289
00:19:29,940 --> 00:19:31,480
Don't give up this fight.

290
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:34,900
Remember, I'm always with you.

291
00:19:38,540 --> 00:19:39,900
I'll save you!

292
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:43,040
No matter what it takes.
